{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是期末考试的最后一天。", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我真是个无可救药的女人。", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪，要上交考卷了哦？」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6528", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……唔嗯」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4015", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咦，这啥好恶心！」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6529", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理从桌上回收了我的卷子后，睁大眼睛惊讶地喊道。", "text_idx": 187, "plain": "爱理从桌上回收了我的卷子后，睁大眼睛惊讶地喊道。", "plain_idx": 187, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这、这是怎么回事……纱凪？」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6530", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我好想消失掉」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4016", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等、等一下，稍微冷静点。\\n　总之这到底是什么情况？」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": "「等、等一下，稍微冷静点。　总之这到底是什么情况？」", "plain_idx": 193, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6531", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「写满了“喜欢喜欢喜欢喜欢喜欢喜欢”……」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6532", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「够了，你快点把这玩意拿走吧」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4017", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是这个……就这样回收上去真的好吗？\\n　试卷的背面都写满了……」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": "「但是这个……就这样回收上去真的好吗？　试卷的背面都写满了……」", "plain_idx": 200, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6533", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在考试的这段时间里，我满脑子都想着新吾的事情。", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后就越想越迷糊了。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……我是从什么时候开始喜欢上新吾的呢。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一定是很早之前就喜欢上了吧。", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是从被公主抱的那时开始？", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不对，应该比那更早。", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也就是说。", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我到底陷得有多深啊啊啊……」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4018", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "双手抱着脑袋陷入了沉思。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在试卷的反面不留空隙地写满了“喜欢”两个字。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可能，我就是有这么喜欢新吾吧。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总、总之，放学后我们稍微谈谈吧？」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6534", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然这样下去会让人担心，不能放着不管啊……」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6535", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过这对我来说也正是个好机会。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正好希望有人能够来听我倾诉。", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后阻止我。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "喜欢上那种人，只会变得更加不幸罢了。", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嘿，你看起来很幸福啊，真是太好了」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6536", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，为什么你能这么轻易就接受了啊？」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4019", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为之前就听过类似的话了」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6537", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有一个能相互理解的朋友，也不知道是好是坏。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理似乎并没有特别吃惊的样子，\\n而是一脸认真地听我的“恋爱八卦”。", "text_idx": 229, "plain": "爱理似乎并没有特别吃惊的样子，而是一脸认真地听我的“恋爱八卦”。", "plain_idx": 230, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「既然你能够写满这么多“喜欢喜欢”，\\n　想必一定是对瓜生着迷到不行了吧」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": "「既然你能够写满这么多“喜欢喜欢”，　想必一定是对瓜生着迷到不行了吧」", "plain_idx": 232, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6538", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「着、着迷什么的……那家伙很温柔，\\n　也有很男子汉的一面，笑容很爽朗，\\n　一到关键时候也很值得依靠……」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": "「着、着迷什么的……那家伙很温柔，　也有很男子汉的一面，笑容很爽朗，　一到关键时候也很值得依靠……」", "plain_idx": 235, "len": 54, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4020", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以就被他迷住了呗？」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6539", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯，被他迷住了」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4021", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我再次用双手抱住了脑袋。", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总感觉，脸颊一直在发烫。", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这种谈话要是被其他人听到了的话，想死的心都有了。", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么，你准备什么时候告白？」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6540", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「告、告白？」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4022", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「既然这么喜欢的话就没什么好犹豫了吧。\\n　要是再忍下去，总有一天连笔记本也会被你写满的，\\n　那太可怕了」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": "「既然这么喜欢的话就没什么好犹豫了吧。　要是再忍下去，总有一天连笔记本也会被你写满的，　那太可怕了」", "plain_idx": 249, "len": 54, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6541", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4023", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这可不是开玩笑。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天在家里，就已经在笔记本上写了一页半了。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我必须要做点什么，\\n不然的话，我甚至无法在活动室正常地面对他了。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": "我必须要做点什么，不然的话，我甚至无法在活动室正常地面对他了。", "plain_idx": 256, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「难道说，之前和你说过的“那个”也明白了吗？」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6542", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「“那个”是指？」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4024", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是班里的同学说过的那个……\\n　是不是想要生瓜生的小孩」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": "「就是班里的同学说过的那个……　是不是想要生瓜生的小孩」", "plain_idx": 262, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6543", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「并、并没有想到那个程度啦」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4025", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「太好了，果然还没到那个地步呢」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6544", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是纱凪真的说想要生瓜生的小孩之类的话，\\n　那我可太受打击了」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": "「要是纱凪真的说想要生瓜生的小孩之类的话，　那我可太受打击了」", "plain_idx": 269, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6545", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「将、将来还是会想要的！」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4026", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……只要是新吾的孩子，我会生一大堆的」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4027", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6546", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但、但这只是将来的打算！并不是说现在立马就要……」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": "「但、但这只是将来的打算！并不是说现在立马就要……」", "plain_idx": 277, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4028", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果你问我想不想要的话，\\n　那当然是想要。要是新吾想要我生的话，\\n　我也会答应就是了……」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": "「如果你问我想不想要的话，　那当然是想要。要是新吾想要我生的话，　我也会答应就是了……」", "plain_idx": 280, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4029", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道了，已经很清楚了。\\n　总之你就是对瓜生喜欢得不得了是吧」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": "「我知道了，已经很清楚了。　总之你就是对瓜生喜欢得不得了是吧」", "plain_idx": 283, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6547", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你、你也不用那么惊讶吧……」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4030", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你的恋爱脑发言我已经听够了。\\n　但既然这么喜欢，为什么不好好传达自己的心意呢？」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": "「你的恋爱脑发言我已经听够了。　但既然这么喜欢，为什么不好好传达自己的心意呢？」", "plain_idx": 288, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6548", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是不这样做的话，有些事会变得很麻烦」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6549", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「变得麻烦是指？」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4031", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为那个人太会察言观色了。\\n　要是纱凪一直是这种情绪，他反而会很担心的」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": "「因为那个人太会察言观色了。　要是纱凪一直是这种情绪，他反而会很担心的」", "plain_idx": 295, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6550", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4032", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正如爱理所说。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那家伙的直觉意外地敏锐，\\n我的心意迟早会被察觉到。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": "那家伙的直觉意外地敏锐，我的心意迟早会被察觉到。", "plain_idx": 300, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是因此被他过多担心的话，不如……", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……明白，我下定决心了」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4033", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天就去向新吾告白」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4034", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正好新吾也有重要的事情要和我说。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也已经下定决心。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后……", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理，那个啊……要是有小宝宝了，\\n　你觉得叫什么名字比较好？」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": "「爱理，那个啊……要是有小宝宝了，　你觉得叫什么名字比较好？」", "plain_idx": 310, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4035", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我怎么可能会知道」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6551", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来我真是个没用的女人。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「很久没有和哥哥一起回去过了呢」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5311", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像真的是欸」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "成功度过了最后一天的期末考试，\\n我陪着樱乃去买东西。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": "成功度过了最后一天的期末考试，我陪着樱乃去买东西。", "plain_idx": 320, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "本来是想和纱凪聊一聊的。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来要等到明天以后才行了。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起来，我这里有一条哥哥在意的消息」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5312", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯，什么？」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你知道明天是什么日子吗？」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5313", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天？」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "12月11日，星期五。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但想不起来是什么特殊的日子。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天是有什么事情吗？」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯，其实……」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5314", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃踮起脚尖，在我的耳边轻声说道。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天是理央亲的生日」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5315", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃的吐息吹过我的耳边。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「原来如此……\\n　但是这没必要像悄悄话一样说吧？」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": "「原来如此……　但是这没必要像悄悄话一样说吧？」", "plain_idx": 339, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这是心情上的问题啦」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5316", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃回到原本的姿势，满足般地微笑着。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，原来是这样，明天是理央的生日啊……」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你要买礼物吗？」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5317", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说的也是，就这么办吧」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然以这个为借口很卑鄙。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，我已经决定了明天要向纱凪传达自己的心情。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从出生以来的第一次告白。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管结果怎么样，我都不想留下后悔。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃也有什么想要的吗，比如玩偶之类的」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用，暂时没有什么特别想要的东西」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5318", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你还真是个好养活的孩子啊」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我可是能成为一位好妻子的」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5319", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，对于这点我也敢保证」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是，我和樱乃便一起去逛各务台商场了。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": "于是，我和樱乃便一起去逛各务台商场了。", "plain_idx": 358, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "至于给理央的礼物，\\n就决定是一个白色的猫咪玩偶了。", "text_idx": 359, "plain": "至于给理央的礼物，就决定是一个白色的猫咪玩偶了。", "plain_idx": 360, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
